#. type: Title ##
#: docs/admin/45.tutorials/15.filezilla.mdx:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatives to Filezilla"
msgstr "Альтернативы FileZilla"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/admin/45.tutorials/15.filezilla.mdx:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "GNU/Linux"
msgstr "GNU/Linux"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/admin/45.tutorials/15.filezilla.mdx:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "From any recent GNU/Linux, you should be able to use the `file manager` to reach your server.\n"
msgstr ""
"В любом современном дистрибутиве GNU/Linux вы сможете подключиться к своему "
"серверу с помощью файлового менеджера ( `file manager`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/admin/45.tutorials/15.filezilla.mdx:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Nautilus from Gnome3 and Dolphin from KDE have features similar to FileZilla, out of the box.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nautilus из GNOME 3 и Dolphin из KDE обладают функциями, схожими с "
"FileZilla, «из коробки».\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/admin/45.tutorials/15.filezilla.mdx:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- [Nautilus Connect](https://help.gnome.org/users/gnome-help/stable/nautilus-connect.html.en)\n"
"- [Dolphin](https://docs.kde.org/stable5/en/dolphin/dolphin/location-bar.html#location-bar-editable-kioslaves)\n"
"- [Tutorial for Nautilus and SFTP](https://www.techrepublic.com/article/how-to-use-linux-file-manager-to-connect-to-an-sftp-server/)\n"
msgstr ""
"- [Nautilus Connect]"
"(https://help.gnome.org/users/gnome-help/stable/nautilus-connect.html.en)\n"
"- [Dolphin](https://docs.kde.org/stable5/en/dolphin/dolphin/location-bar.html"
"#location-bar-editable-kioslaves)\n"
"- [Руководство по Nautilus и SFTP](https://www.techrepublic.com/article/"
"how-to-use-linux-file-manager-to-connect-to-an-sftp-server/)\n"

